  "intro": "Each problem uses a single logarithm rule applied once, or a one-step exponential or logarithmic equation. Use the product rule $\\log_b(MN)=\\log_b M+\\log_b N$, the quotient rule $\\log_b\\left(\\frac{M}{N}\\right)=\\log_b M-\\log_b N$, the power rule $\\log_b(M^p)=p\\log_b M$, and the identities $\\log_b b=1$, $\\log_b 1=0$. Give exact values.",
